In order to constitute an  o f f e n c e u / s 1 3 8 N I A c t , f o l l o w i n g i n g r e d i e n t s a n d requirements are required to be proved and fulfilled:
(i) A cheque is drawn by a person on an account maintained by him with a banker;
(ii) The said cheque is drawn for payment of any amount of money to  another person for the discharge, in whole or in part, of any debt or other liability  ("debt or other liability", being a legally enforceable debt or other liability);
(iii) The said cheque is returned unpaid by the bank either for the reason of  'insufficient funds' or for reason of 'exceeds arrangement';
(iv) The said cheque must be presented within 3 months or within the  period of validity, whichever is earlier;
(v) A notice regarding the dishonour of the cheque and demanding the payment  of the amount of the cheque in question is given by the payee to the drawer of  t h e c h e q u e w i t h i n 3 0 d a y s o f t h e r e c e i p t o f  information regarding dishonour of cheque;
